### 1. Login (Success - Admin user)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 2. Login (Failed - Wrong Password)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 3. Login (Failed - Validation Error, Missing Fields)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin"
}
